  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-green pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Element Drain</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6f/Victor_Barlow_%28Earth-616%29_001.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150822201315\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Victor Barlow (Earth-616) 001\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6f/Victor_Barlow_%28Earth-616%29_001.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150822201315\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6f/Victor_Barlow_%28Earth-616%29_001.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150822201315 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6f/Victor_Barlow_%28Earth-616%29_001.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150822201315 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Victor Barlow (Earth-616) 001\" width=\"239\" height=\"401\" data-image-key=\"Victor_Barlow_%28Earth-616%29_001.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Victor Barlow (Earth-616) 001.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Victor Barlow (Marvel Comics) is able to leech calcium from other people's bones, inducing pain and reducing the victim's bones to that of rubber</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Drain periodic elemental substances from the bodies or forms of others.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb periodic elemental substances from the bodies or forms of others</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Periodic_Table_Powers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Periodic Table Powers\">Periodic Table Powers</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a>. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElement_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Elemental Property Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElement_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can drain periodic elemental properties from the physical bodies or forms of others in their vicinity. For example, the user can drain the calcium from the bones of others to make them brittle and weak, or drain the carbon from carbon-based life to cause instant death.  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElement_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Inducement\" title=\"Death Inducement\">Death Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dehydration\" title=\"Dehydration\">Dehydration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Deoxygenation\" title=\"Deoxygenation\">Deoxygenation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enervation_Inducement\" title=\"Enervation Inducement\">Enervation Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pain_Inducement\" title=\"Pain Inducement\">Pain Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Fluid_Absorption\" title=\"Bodily Fluid Absorption\">Bodily Fluid Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Absorption\" title=\"Blood Absorption\">Blood Absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Consumption\" title=\"Blood Consumption\">Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Consumption\" title=\"Bone Consumption\">Bone Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Milk_Absorption\" title=\"Milk Absorption\">Milk Absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Milk_Consumption\" title=\"Milk Consumption\">Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Moisture_Absorption\" title=\"Moisture Absorption\">Moisture Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nutrient_Absorption\" title=\"Nutrient Absorption\">Nutrient Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElement_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">Matter Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Drain\" title=\"Total Drain\">Total Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Consumption\" title=\"Organic Consumption\">Consumption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElement_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cannot control the element absorbed.</li>\n<li>Users may be limited to absorbing one specific element from another.</li>\n<li>Users may be limited on how much they can absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElement_Drain